OL,3,GNEWSAGTA 6 hacker released on licence
OL,4,Awith warning 'don't let this happen
OL,5,Aagain'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA cyber criminal who hacked the maker
OL,8,Fof Grand Theft Auto has been released
OL,9,Fon licence on the same day as being
OL,10,Fsentenced to 7 years in prison.
OL,12,FMultiple offender Arion Kurtaj, from
OL,13,FOxford, was released from custody with
OL,14,Fthe judge warning him: "Don't let this
OL,15,Fhappen again."
OL,17,FThe now 21-year-old hacked several
OL,18,Fcompanies and individuals, including
OL,19,FGTA 6-maker Rockstar Games, whom he
OL,20,Ftried to extort after stealing clips of
OL,21,Fthe unfinished game in 2022.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
